  "description": "Skrillex’s first year as an independent artist since 2009 moved at breakneck speed. A glance backwards at his calendar telegraphs a clear trajectory for what ranks as one of his most momentous years yet: the ‘Kora’ EP; an appearance at the 68th annual Grammy Awards; a surprise b2b during BZRP’s Ultra Miami set; the launch of his two-day festival and cultural platform, CONTRA Berlin; countless IDs; his fifth studio album, ‘SOMA’; and a sold-out day party at Seattle’s Gas Works Park, where he played alongside Porter Robinson. Catch your breath now, while the dynamo tees up whatever is coming next.",
